/// Whether a multi-candidate fit slot satisfies the candidate-identity contract
/// (spec/PRIMITIVES.md §SizeThatFits): the `FIT_QUERY` table must have one
/// ascending threshold per child, so child `i` ⇔ candidate `i`. A malformed
/// frame (length mismatch or non-ascending table) is NOT gated — the renderer
/// falls back to showing the threshold-0 child only.
fn fit_candidates_valid(node: &Node) -> bool {
